- * row-equilibrated LU factors; every call still checks floating-island current
- * balance and every original KCL/source equation. No allocations on solve. */
+/* Reusable bounded matrix workspace. LU reuse requires byte-identical current
+ * reduced equations in the same order/dimension; known voltages always use
+ * current ideal-source values and source currents are recovered from KCL.
+ * Every call still checks floating-island current balance and every original
+ * KCL/source equation. No allocations or cached voltage outputs on solve. */
